actual_output:
The 'await' block consists of three parts

First part: an expression evaluates to a promise;
its content is shown while the promise is unresolved

Second part: :then;
its content is shown if the promise resolves successfully

Third part: :catch;
its content is shown if an error occurs while resolving the promise

d_dot:
